# The Skills Quality Index corpus is TRANSIENT: scripts/skills-corpus.mjs
# fetches it from the commits research/skills-index/manifest.json pins, and
# scripts/skills-index.mjs grades it into REPORT.md + the site JSON. The clones
# themselves are never committed. On 2026-08-02 a plain `git add -A` swept all
# three in as gitlinks (mode 160000) with no .gitmodules, which gives anyone
# cloning this repo three broken entries. Only the manifest and the report are
# the artifact.
research/skills-index/*/
